Theme|Discussion Focus / Sample Questions
Career Decisions Nobody Talks About|How did you choose between technical depth, people leadership and business roles? Which career decision had the biggest impact?
Lessons from Failure|What was your biggest professional mistake? How did you recover, and what would you do differently today?
What Leadership Really Notices|What behaviours make an employee stand out? What differentiates a strong performer from someone ready for the next level?
Navigating Organisational Change|How should employees respond to restructuring, leadership changes, changing priorities or movement between teams?
Visibility Without Self-Promotion|How can employees create visibility while remaining authentic? How should they communicate their contributions effectively?
Building Influence Without Authority|How can non-officers influence senior stakeholders, challenge decisions respectfully and drive outcomes without formal power?
The Future of Careers in the AI Era|Which skills will become more valuable? How will AI change technology roles, leadership expectations and career progression?
Difficult Conversations at Work|How should employees handle disagreement, negative feedback, missed promotions, difficult managers and conflicts within teams?
Sponsorship, Mentorship and Networks|How do employees find mentors and sponsors? What makes a senior leader willing to advocate for someone?
The Human Side of Leadership|How do leaders manage pressure, uncertainty, work-life priorities, difficult decisions and expectations from different stakeholders?
